<!--
templates/wiki-index-cards.md.tmpl — M037/P01/T01 FR-1 card-grid template.

Consumed by scripts/wiki/wiki-generate-stubs.sh::render_landing_cards.

DEFAULT_BLURBS section-name -> icon|title|blurb|section-path mapping. Used
by FR-3 when .orchestrator/config.yml has no `wiki.landing_cards:` block
(or the list is empty). Section names match top-level nav entries
enumerated by wiki-generate-nav.sh / parsed from wiki/mkdocs.yml's nav:
block. The renderer cross-references the present nav top-level names
against DEFAULT_BLURBS and emits one card per intersection.

Icon syntax is mkdocs-material emoji-shortcode form (hyphens, not slashes).
Renders as a glyph when pymdownx.emoji is enabled in markdown_extensions;
renders as literal text otherwise. Operators wanting glyphs add the
extension to wiki/mkdocs.yml's markdown_extensions: list.

Format: name|icon|title|blurb|section-path (pipe-delimited; no pipes
inside any value). One record per `# ` line.

# DEFAULT_BLURBS
# Constitution|fontawesome-solid-scale-balanced|Constitution|Project constitution. Governing principles for every decision.|constitution.md
# Decisions|fontawesome-solid-list-check|Decisions|Decision log. Architectural choices, rationale, revision history.|decisions.md
# Glossary|fontawesome-solid-book|Glossary|Project glossary. Terms and one-line definitions.|glossary.md
# Knowledge|fontawesome-solid-lightbulb|Knowledge|Consolidated narrative. Patterns, decisions, lessons in prose form.|knowledge.md
# Knowledge Entries|fontawesome-solid-book-bookmark|Knowledge Entries|Granular MEM entries by category — patterns, conventions, lessons.|knowledge/index.md
# Milestones|fontawesome-solid-flag-checkered|Milestones|Per-milestone phases, tasks, and outcomes.|milestones/index.md
# Milestone Summary|fontawesome-solid-clipboard-list|Milestone Summary|Cross-milestone rollup. Build summary, extension guide, milestone history.|milestone-summary.md
# Reference|fontawesome-solid-folder-tree|Reference|Reference corpus. Regulatory docs, training materials, glossaries.|reference/index.md
# Proposals|fontawesome-solid-pen-to-square|Proposals|Proposal drafts and historical proposals.|proposals/index.md
# END_DEFAULT_BLURBS
-->

